   "text": "Each input times its weight. Pixel 21 is lit at 0.625 and its weight is 0.1565; the product is 0.0978, how hard this pixel pushes the neuron. Pixel 51, at 0.9375 with weight −0.3018, pushes the other way: −0.2829, the strongest push of the 64. The 7 has 33 dark pixels, and 0 times anything is 0: for this picture those 33 weights do nothing, whatever their value. 64 multiplications, 64 products.",
