   "title": "Add",
   "text": "The 64 products are added into one number. The positive ones come to 1.3233, the negative ones to −0.8142. The bias is added last: at the random start every bias is 0, so it changes nothing yet, but it is a knob like the weights and training will turn it. The sum is z = 0.5091. That is all this neuron knows about the 7: one number, built from 64 pushes.",
