   "title": "The blame comes back",
   "text": "Pill 09 gave every neuron a blame: the slope of the loss against its sum. The 16 neurons of the next row already have theirs, since the walk back arrives from the loss row by row. Each sends back its blame times the weight on the wire between them. The 16 products add to −0.07019, the slope of the loss against this neuron’s output. Back through the squash, times its slope 0.7798: −0.05474, the blame of this neuron’s sum. Negative: the 7’s loss falls if the sum grows.",
